silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_03_materialization_spine_sections_03_validate_step_concrete_anchor_6 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_validate_step #6', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling.." .
